      "id": "p1",
      "text": "In a move to silence a critic, law enforcement in Seoul moved to restore order after a content creator used AI-generated audio and manipulated chat screenshots to claim the actor dated a late co-star while she was a minor. The arrest of this alleged whistleblower, following what is framed as an alleged motive to exploit the system for profit, has led to significant professional impact on the protected celebrity, halting their endorsements and public appearances.",
